  "job_B17.2_20251003_114404": {
    "text": "On \u00feison geare w\u00e6s sancte Dunstan geboren.\nAnd he leofode LXIII geare and on \u00feam LXIIII geare he for\u00f0ferde XIIII kalendas Jun.\nHer for\u00f0ferde sancte Dunstan arcebiscop.\nHer Siric biscop for to Rome.\nHer Siric arcebiscop for\u00f0ferde.\nHer \u00c6lfric biscop for to Rome.\nHer for\u00f0ferde \u00c6lfric biscop.\nHer \u00c6lfeh biscop for to Rome.\nHer w\u00e6s Cantwarabyrig gewunnan.\nHer w\u00e6s sancte \u00c6lfeh gemartyrod.\nHer for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelred kyng.\nHer w\u00e6s Cnut gecoran to kynge.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Lyfing arcebiscop and \u00c6gelno\u00f0 decanus feng to \u00fean biscoprice.\nHer for \u00c6gelno\u00fe biscop to Rome.\nHer w\u00e6s sancte \u00c6lfeh gefered of lundene to Cristes cyrcian.\nHer for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelwine decanus.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Cnut kyng.\nHer for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelno\u00f0 arcebiscop and Eadsige biscop feng to biscoprice.\nHer Eadsige biscop for to Rome and Harold kyng for\u00f0ferde.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Har\u00f0acnut kyng.\nHer w\u00e6s Eaweard gehalgod to kynge.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Eadsige arcebiscop and Rodbert feng to biscoprice.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Godwine eorl.\nHer Benedictus papa sende Stigande \u00feone pallium.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Godwine biscop and Wulfric abbod.\nHer for\u00f0ferde Eadward kyng and her com Willelm.\nHer on \u00feison geare barn Cristes cyrce.\nOn \u00feison geare com Landfranc abbod and hine man halgode to bisceope to Cristes cyrcian.\nHer Landfranc arcebiscop sta\u00f0olede Cristes cyrican V id Apl.\nOn \u00feison geare man sloh W\u00e6l\u00feeof II k Jun.\nOn \u00f0isan g\u00e6re, Landfranc arcebiscop let niman sancte Eadburgan on Liminge, And bryngan \u00e6t\nOn \u00feisan g\u00e6re for\u00f0ferde Willelm cing and his sunu Willelm fing to rice.\nOn \u00feison g\u00e6re for\u00f0ferde Landfranc arcebiscop.\nOn \u00f0ison g\u00e6re me bletsede Ansealme to biscope II n Decemb and on \u00f0isan ilcan g\u00e6re me scloch\nHer ferde \u00fe\u00e6t Cristene folc to gewinnene \u00fe\u00e6t h\u00e6\u00f0ene.\nOn \u00feyson g\u00e6re ferde Anselm to Roma, VIII kl Novemb.\nOn \u00feyson g\u00e6re wear\u00f0 Willelm cyng ofslagen IIII n Aug and Henri his bro\u00feer fing to \u00fean rice, and\nOn \u00feison g\u00e6re man sceawede sancte \u00c6lfeh and me hine funde his lichamen eall ansund and \u00fe\u00e6t\nHer for\u00feferde Anselm \u00e6rcebiscop.\nOn \u00f0isan g\u00e6re me halgode Cristes circian IIII non Mai.",
